WEBVTT

00:06:00.963 --> 00:06:02.676
Let us take this example.

00:06:03.549 --> 00:06:05.793
How would you like to have

00:06:06.742 --> 00:06:08.945
a wonderful, versatile staple

00:06:09.817 --> 00:06:13.113
that is available abundantly
in your environment?

00:06:13.137 --> 00:06:15.298
All you have to do is gather it,

00:06:15.322 --> 00:06:17.695
dry it, store it,

00:06:17.719 --> 00:06:20.093
and you have it for your whole year

00:06:20.117 --> 00:06:24.033
to cook as many different
kinds of dishes as you want with it.

00:06:24.701 --> 00:06:28.516
India had just such a food,
called "mahua,"

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.981
this flower over there.